# Environment configuration - ALL VALUES ARE OPTIONAL.
#
# The framework runs entirely without this file. Copy it to .env only if you
# want the optional runtime locator healing described in the README.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Never commit a real .env - it is listed in .gitignore.

# Optional: enables AI locator healing at runtime.
# Healing is ALSO off by default per scenario file; set "enableAutoHealing": true
# in a scenario's config block to opt that suite in.
# With no key set, healing is skipped with a warning and the test fails normally.
# A heal never modifies data/locators - proposals are written to
# test-results/heal-report.json for review.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxx
